+
+
+    // FUNCTION | A Tiny Picture of a Given Type, and Its Managed Name
+    // ------------------------------------------------------------
+    // The bytes start with the type's real signature (all the worker sniffs);
+    // name(slug) ends in the first ten hex digits of their SHA-256.
+    // ------------------------------------------------------------
